abstract: "Reproducibility snapshot for an ECC 2027 submission and technical notes version 1.2. Includes continuous-time and sampled safety-filter experiments, a new fixed-period study, frozen HJB policies, analytic and interval certificates, and editable LaTeX sources. No acceptance, publication DOI, or repository release tag is asserted."
